[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:An Exciting Trip]
[00:13.95]Why is Tim finding this trip exciting?
[00:21.31]I have just received a letter from my brother, Tim.
[00:26.16]He is in Australia.
[00:28.65]He has been there for six months.
[00:32.16]Tim is an engineer.
[00:35.09]He is working for a big firm and he has already visited a great number of different places in Australia.
[00:44.78]He has just bought an Australian car and has gone to Alice Springs, a small town in the centre of Australia.
[00:54.85]He will soon visit Darwin.
[00:57.90]From there, he will fly to Perth.
[01:01.87]My brother has never been abroad before, so he is finding this trip very exciting.
